  "metadata": {
    "title": "CARBCOMN - Dataset of Early Research Outcomes - Mix Design of 3D-printable Mixes Based on Industrial Slags",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.17092152",
    "publication_date": "2025-09-10",
    "description": "<p>This dataset presents the early research outcomes from the initial experimental test program under the CARBCOMN project. The program was designed as the first iteration of an optimization protocol aimed at developing extrudable mixes based on slag-only formulations, i.e 100% secondary constituents that solely rely on carbonation curing for full strength development. The dataset provides a comprehensive record of the early findings and brings together information from several experimental domains.</p>",
